{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Furball Blitz!",
    "steam_appid": 2897520,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897520/extras/7bc273a6b67c94cc84b39775e4afd6d3.avif?t=1754747850\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introducing Furball Blitz!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Furball Blitz \u2014 where cute animal soldiers charge through space with grit, guns, and just a bit of madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with these not-so-fluffy warriors in a chaotic, bullet-soaked, rogue-lite shooter where every run is a fight to survive \u2014 and escape alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough offers a new adventure, where you'll wield different weapons and navigate dangerous zones filled with incoming bullets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897520/extras/cbba46988031cded22b935db71341ba8.avif?t=1754747850\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons, weapons, more weapons!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The armory boasts over 50 unique weapons, ranked across five performance tiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From pistols and bazookas to cluster bombs, high-caliber rifles, drone bombers... even the infamous Mini Nuke and MIRVs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These wildly unconventional weapons \u2014 the kind you'd never expect in a typical FPS \u2014 charge into battle with a perfectly straight face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry up to three at a time, and unleash chaos with combos only you could come up with. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897520/extras/f50a74f995ce9cf8f5cf2115abe40a3f.avif?t=1754747850\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power Up, Inside and Out</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During combat</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance weapons with random modifiers.<br>Add homing guidance to piercing weapons, or increase the blast radius on your bazooka!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack powerful relics for crazy synergies. <br>Grab power-ups and mix relics to amplify your strengths \u2014 and patch up your weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use active items strategically.<br>Throw bombs, replenish ammo, boost your firepower, deploy emergency shields \u2014 and turn the tide in a flash.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside of combat,</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger with every run by investing in a trait tree that offers permanent upgrades and playstyle customization.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897520/extras/0532c31eb95048020a41129c61ffa7fb.avif?t=1754747850\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don't fight alone!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call in support drones mid-battle to refill your ammo and patch up your health, and equip D.O.G.G.I.E with extra weapons and send him into the fray.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D.O.G.G.I.E provides cover fire, stores your spare weapons, and always has your back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course, duo multiplayer is fully supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun alone or with a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm and battle together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897520/extras/e7c6c5e3546f87f1d0d91978fc8bff24.avif?t=1754747850\" width=600 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upcoming Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the current version features only the roguelike dungeon crawling mode, several exciting new modes are on the way:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defense Mode<br>Team up and hold the line against waves of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivor Mode<br>Fend off endless hordes and grow stronger with every second.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deathmatch Mode<br>Prove your skills in intense PvP showdowns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All modes will support duo co-op, so you can always bring a friend along for the ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, new weapons, relics, and gameplay content will continue to roll out with future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly \u2014 we want to hear from you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furball Blitz is built with the community, and your feedback and ideas truly shape the future of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your thoughts anytime \u2014 we're always listening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897520/extras/15a8a367c03f41f2c11edf7d34cf9c96.avif?t=1754747850\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Head to the battlefield now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is chaotic. The soldiers are adorable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And under your command, they'll become unstoppable warriors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your very own cute \u2014 and utterly explosive \u2014 legend in Furball Blitz!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897520/extras/7bc273a6b67c94cc84b39775e4afd6d3.avif?t=1754747850\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introducing Furball Blitz!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Furball Blitz \u2014 where cute animal soldiers charge through space with grit, guns, and just a bit of madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with these not-so-fluffy warriors in a chaotic, bullet-soaked, rogue-lite shooter where every run is a fight to survive \u2014 and escape alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough offers a new adventure, where you'll wield different weapons and navigate dangerous zones filled with incoming bullets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897520/extras/cbba46988031cded22b935db71341ba8.avif?t=1754747850\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons, weapons, more weapons!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The armory boasts over 50 unique weapons, ranked across five performance tiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From pistols and bazookas to cluster bombs, high-caliber rifles, drone bombers... even the infamous Mini Nuke and MIRVs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These wildly unconventional weapons \u2014 the kind you'd never expect in a typical FPS \u2014 charge into battle with a perfectly straight face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry up to three at a time, and unleash chaos with combos only you could come up with. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\