</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm and battle together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897520/extras/e7c6c5e3546f87f1d0d91978fc8bff24.avif?t=1754747850\" width=600 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upcoming Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the current version features only the roguelike dungeon crawling mode, several exciting new modes are on the way:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defense Mode<br>Team up and hold the line against waves of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivor Mode<br>Fend off endless hordes and grow stronger with every second.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deathmatch Mode<br>Prove your skills in intense PvP showdowns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All modes will support duo co-op, so you can always bring a friend along for the ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, new weapons, relics, and gameplay content will continue to roll out with future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly \u2014 we want to hear from you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furball Blitz is built with the community, and your feedback and ideas truly shape the future of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your thoughts anytime \u2014 we're always listening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897520/extras/15a8a367c03f41f2c11edf7d34cf9c96.avif?t=1754747850\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Head to the battlefield now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is chaotic. The soldiers are adorable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And under your command, they'll become unstoppable warriors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your very own cute \u2014 and utterly explosive \u2014 legend in Furball Blitz!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
